      <h2>3 Ordering Rules for Peak Blizzard Enjoyment</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Request "Double Blended" or "Lightly Blended":</strong> If you love fine dispersion where every bite tastes like the mix-in, ask for <em>double blended</em>. If you prefer large, recognizable candy bar nuggets, ask for <em>lightly blended</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>The Mini Size Offers Peak Sensory Return:</strong> Sensory research demonstrates that palate fatigue begins after 6 to 8 ounces of high-sugar frozen dairy. The 6 oz Mini delivers 100% of the flavor euphoria without the lethargic sugar crash.</li>
        <li><strong>Enforce the Upside-Down Flip:</strong> The flip isn't just drive-thru theater; it proves your treat has sufficient aeration and thick overrun rather than melted slop. If an employee hands it to you upright without the flip at a participating store, politely ask for your next-visit voucher.</li>
      </ol>

